# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sharp Slate configuration. Copy this file to ".env" and fill in what you want.
# EVERYTHING HERE IS OPTIONAL. With no keys at all, the app still runs and grades
# every pitcher's strikeout prop — it just labels them "analysis only" because it
# has no market line to measure an edge against.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- Live betting odds (optional) --------------------------------------------
# Unlocks true expected-value + Kelly staking by comparing the model to real
# vig-removed market prices. Free tier = 500 requests/month.
# Get a key at: https://the-odds-api.com/
ODDS_API_KEY=

# Pitcher strikeout PROP lines (over/under X.5 K) are a separate, pricier class
# of market on The Odds API and burn more of your monthly quota. Leave at 0 to
# use moneylines only (game-level edges). Set to 1 to also pull strikeout props.
ODDS_PLAYER_PROPS=0

# --- AI write-ups (optional) -------------------------------------------------
# If set, pick explanations are rephrased by Claude for a more natural read.
# Claude is told to use ONLY the numbers the model computed and invent nothing.
# Without this key, the app uses a built-in deterministic template instead.
# Get a key at: https://console.anthropic.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6
